<!doctype html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>{% block title %}La Canebière Académie{% endblock %}</title>
  <link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 100 100'><text y='.9em' font-size='90'>🐪</text></svg>">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Oswald:wght@500;700&family=Source+Sans+3:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  {% block head %}{% endblock %}
  <style>
    :root {
      --bleu: #2FAEE0;
      --bleu-fonce: #1B75BC;
      --marine: #0B2341;
      --or: #C9A227;
      --sable: #C8BBA6;
      --rouge: #D64541;
      --fond: #F4F8FB;
      --carte: #FFFFFF;
      --texte: #0B2341;
      --doux: #5B6B7F;
      --ligne: #E3EAF0;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: var(--fond);
      color: var(--texte);
      font: 400 16px/1.5 "Source Sans 3", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    }
    a { color: var(--bleu-fonce); }
    h1, h2, h3 { font-family: Oswald, Impact, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .02em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .wrap { max-width: 1040px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 16px; }

    /* -- barre de navigation ------------------------------------------- */
    nav {
      background: var(--marine);
      color: white;
      font-size: 15px;
    }
    nav .wrap { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px 20px; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; }
    nav a { color: white; text-decoration: none; opacity: .85; }
    nav a:hover { opacity: 1; text-decoration: underline; }
    nav .academie { margin-left: auto; color: var(--bleu); opacity: 1; font-weight: 600; }

    /* -- bandeau: le chameau ------------------------------------------- */
    .hero {
      position: relative;
      color: white;
      background:
        linear-gradient(90deg, var(--marine) 0%, var(--marine) 38%, rgba(11, 35, 65, .55) 58%, rgba(11, 35, 65, 0) 80%),
        url("https://horsjeu.net/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/Blaah-et-lapin.jpg") right center / auto 100% no-repeat,
        var(--marine);
      border-bottom: 6px solid var(--bleu);
    }
    .hero .wrap { position: relative; min-height: 250px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; padding-top: 24px; padding-bottom: 84px; }
    .hero .surtitre { font-family: Oswald, sans-serif; font-weight: 500; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .15em; color: var(--bleu); font-size: 15px; }
    .hero h1 { margin: 4px 0 8px; font-size: clamp(38px, 7vw, 64px); line-height: 1; }
    .hero h1 .etoile { color: var(--or); font-size: .5em; vertical-align: super; }
    .hero p { margin: 0; max-width: 30em; color: #D5E4F0; }
    .bulle {
      position: absolute;
      right: max(16px, calc(50% - 520px + 120px));
      top: 26px;
      background: white;
      color: var(--marine);
      font: 700 22px/1 Oswald, sans-serif;
      padding: 10px 16px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      transform: rotate(-6deg);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0, 0, 0, .25);
      animation: blaah 4s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    .bulle::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      left: 22px;
      bottom: -12px;
      border: 8px solid transparent;
      border-top: 12px solid white;
      border-left: 4px solid transparent;
    }
    @keyframes blaah { 0%, 80%, 100% { transform: rotate(-6deg) scale(1); } 88% { transform: rotate(-3deg) scale(1.12); } }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .bulle { animation: none; } }
    @media (max-width: 560px) { .bulle { top: 4px; font-size: 16px; padding: 7px 12px; } }

    /* -- contenu --------------------------------------------------------- */
    /* .wrap fixe déjà le padding horizontal */
    main.wrap { padding-bottom: 48px; }
    section { margin-top: 36px; }
    section > h2 { margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 26px; color: var(--marine); }
    section > h2::before { content: ""; display: inline-block; width: 10px; height: .8em; background: var(--bleu); margin-right: 10px; border-radius: 2px; }
    section > p.legende { margin: 0 0 14px; color: var(--doux); }
    .carte { background: var(--carte); border: 1px solid var(--ligne); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px; }

    /* les chiffres de la saison */
    .bilan { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(140px, 1fr)); gap: 12px; margin-top: -60px; position: relative; }
    .tuile { background: var(--carte); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(11, 35, 65, .10); border-top: 4px solid var(--marine); }
    .tuile .valeur { font: 700 34px/1.1 Oswald, sans-serif; }
    .tuile .label { color: var(--doux); font-size: 14px; }
    .tuile.victoire { border-color: var(--bleu); } .tuile.victoire .valeur { color: var(--bleu-fonce); }
    .tuile.nul { border-color: var(--sable); }
    .tuile.defaite { border-color: var(--rouge); } .tuile.defaite .valeur { color: var(--rouge); }


    footer { background: var(--marine); color: #D5E4F0; padding: 28px 0; font-size: 14px; }
    footer a { color: var(--bleu); }
    footer .blaah { font: 700 28px Oswald, sans-serif; color: white; }
{% block style %}{% endblock %}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <nav>
    <div class="wrap">
      {% block nav %}{% endblock %}
      <a class="academie" href="{{ academie_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Lire La Canebière Académie ↗</a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <header class="hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="surtitre">La Canebière Académie</div>
      {% block hero %}{% endblock %}
      <p>Des statistiques parfaitement inutiles sur les académies de Blaah, le chameau qui note les joueurs de l'OM.</p>
      <div class="bulle" aria-hidden="true">Blaah !</div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="wrap">
{% block content %}{% endblock %}
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="blaah">🐪 Blaah !</div>
      <p>Toutes les académies sont sur <a href="{{ academie_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">horsjeu.net</a>. Les images du chameau et de Mr Lapin viennent de là-bas aussi.
        {% block footer %}{% endblock %}</p>
    </div>
  </footer>
{% block scripts %}{% endblock %}
</body>
</html>
